            { text: "therefore neither does the square on {BG} have to the square on {GC}",
              visible: BGS,
              highlighted: ["BG","CG"] },
            { text: "the ratio which a square number has to a square number.",
              visible: BGS,
              highlighted: ["BG","CG"] },
            { text: "Therefore {BG} is incommensurable in length with {GC}.",
              visible: BGS,
              highlighted: ["BG","CG"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "BG, GC incommensurable in length", ref: "X.9" }] },
            { text: "And both are rational, therefore {BG} and {GC} are rational straight lines commensurable in square only.",
              visible: BGS,
              highlighted: ["BG","CG"] },
            { text: "Therefore {BC} is an apotome.",
              visible: APO,
              highlighted: ["BC"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "BC apotome", ref: "X.73" }] },
            { text: "I say next that it is also a fifth apotome.",
